58788	58882	58786	58786	Mordaunt	534	" your kind gift may have given me favour , but it has not been able to keep it for me , or I have not been able to keep it for myself.--What matters it ? I shall learn to set as little by others as they do by me . My father says that I shall soon leave these islands , and therefore , Mother Norna , I will return to you your fairy gift , that it may bring more lasting luck to some other than it has done to me . "
