110833	111123	110814	110814	she	4522	" I left the house at midnight -- I had to pass my father 's door , and I perceived it was open -- I thought he watched us ; and , that the sound of my steps might not break his slumbers , I closed the fatal door -- a light and trivial action -- but , God in Heaven ! what were the consequences!--At morn , the room was full of suffocating vapour -- my father was dead -- dead through my act -- dead through my disobedience -- dead through my infamy ! All that follows is mist and darkness -- a choking , suffocating , stifling mist envelopes all that I said and did , all that was said and done , until I became assured that my doom was accomplished , and walked forth the calm and terrible being you now behold me -- the Queen of the Elements -- the sharer in the power of those beings to whom man and his passions give such sport as the tortures of the dog - fish afford the fisherman , when he pierces his eyes with thorns , and turns him once more into his native element , to traverse the waves in blindness and agony.[60 ] No , maidens , she whom you see before you is impassive to the follies of which your minds are the sport . I am she that have made the offering -- I am she that bereaved the giver of the gift of life which he gave me -- the dark saying has been interpreted by my deed , and I am taken from humanity , to be something pre - eminently powerful , pre - eminently wretched ! "
